Three CMOS inverters driving explicit load capacitances
* Provenance: original level-one MOS ring oscillator and startup state.
* sansho-verify: pss-ng v(out)
Vdd supply 0 2
.model nm NMOS(VTO=0.5 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model pm PMOS(VTO=-0.5 KP=50u LAMBDA=0.02)
Mn1 out b 0 0 nm W=4u L=1u
Mp1 out b supply supply pm W=8u L=1u
Mn2 a out 0 0 nm W=4u L=1u
Mp2 a out supply supply pm W=8u L=1u
Mn3 b a 0 0 nm W=4u L=1u
Mp3 b a supply supply pm W=8u L=1u
C1 out 0 1p ic=2
C2 a 0 1p ic=0
C3 b 0 1p ic=0
.ic v(supply)=2
.options itl4=60
.pss 40meg 150n out 256 10 25 1e-3 uic
.end
